    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you, our hero space alien to complete this light-hearted short third-person pov sci-fi adventure. Explore the shuttle hangar bay on the space station, interact with gruff NPCs, power up the hover jack, transport an aggressive alien pet, fix a smoking shuttle engine with your space wrench that you left up in the break room, launch the shuttle from the control room, etc.\u00a0A short, quirky sci-fi adventure with no combat and lots of charm.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you, our hero space alien to complete this light-hearted short third-person pov sci-fi adventure. Explore the shuttle hangar bay on the space station, interact with gruff NPCs, power up the hover jack, transport an aggressive alien pet, fix a smoking shuttle engine with your space wrench that you left up in the break room, launch the shuttle from the control room, etc.\u00a0A short, quirky sci-fi adventure with no combat and lots of charm.</p>",
    "short_description": "Play as a space alien in a light-hearted third-person 3D sci-fi adventure. Explore a space station hangar, power up the hover jack, transport an aggressive alien pet onto the shuttle, fix the broken shuttle engine, etc. All with the help from your floating AI companion. Gamepad suggested.",
